# Registration (see "Registration" in CLAUDE.md). The first account needs nothing; after it,
# /register is closed unless this invite code (16+ characters) is set, and then asks for it.
# The e2e suite registers a fresh account on every run, so development sets one.
REGISTRATION_CODE="dev-only-invite-code-change-me"
